    "analysis": "The STKO table in SAP is used to store header information for bills of materials (BOMs). It includes data such as the BOM category, status, base unit of measure, and creation and change information. STKO is typically used in conjunction with other tables, such as STPO (BOM item data) and STAS (BOM status), to manage and track BOMs in the system.",
